  m_Name: NPC_25_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "A crate slipped off the dock and landed squarely across my forearm.\nI heard the crack before I felt it.\nI've kept the arm tucked in since. It hurts when the sleeve pulls."
